AltoLeverageSwapperMultiTarget::setWhitelisted(address,bool)
├── given caller is not owner even when the requested status is unchanged
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount before status validation and preserve the mapping
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when requested status equals the current false or true status
    │   └── it should revert with AltoLeverageSwapperInvalidInput and preserve the mapping
    └── when requested status changes
        ├── when account is nonzero
        │   └── it should allow adding then removing the account
        ├── when account is zero
        │   └── it should allow adding then removing the zero address
        ├── when another account is already whitelisted
        │   └── it should keep that account whitelisted while adding and removing the requested account
        ├── it should store the requested status while preserving owner and unrelated whitelist entries
        └── it should emit exactly one SetWhitelisted with the indexed account and requested status
